WEBVTT

00:11.306 --> 00:17.306
[EREN babbling]

00:27.156 --> 00:33.156
[EREN crying]

00:34.576 --> 00:37.746
This must be one of
our Dad's memories.

00:37.826 --> 00:40.586
He looked every bit
as innocent as you did.

00:40.666 --> 00:42.086
Happy, too.

00:42.166 --> 00:44.586
The man pushed his friends
and family straight into hell,

00:44.666 --> 00:47.876
yet there's no trace
of guilt on his face.

00:47.966 --> 00:49.886
Why are you showing me this?

00:49.966 --> 00:52.506
So you'll understand who he was.

00:52.596 --> 00:56.226
He sacrificed his children
on the altar of nationalism

00:56.306 --> 00:59.646
and brainwashed us both
in the name of Eldia.

00:59.726 --> 01:03.026
Just wait. Soon, you'll see.

01:12.986 --> 01:15.366
Guess you pulled it off, Grisha.

01:15.446 --> 01:18.536
You built a new life somewhere
so far from your old one

01:18.616 --> 01:21.206
that you could leave
your mistakes behind.

01:21.286 --> 01:23.706
No one blames you here.

01:23.786 --> 01:26.916
Not for what you did
to your first family.

01:27.006 --> 01:29.506
Nor for the way you forgot us.

01:31.756 --> 01:33.216
[ZEKE]
Let's go.

01:50.146 --> 01:51.566
[ZEKE]
Next.

01:55.026 --> 01:56.536
Look at this, Eren.

01:56.616 --> 01:59.156
That's the real Grisha Jaeger.

01:59.246 --> 02:01.116
He used his job as
a doctor to get close

02:01.206 --> 02:04.206
to powerful people
within the walls.

02:04.286 --> 02:06.416
That was how he
hunted down the King.

02:06.506 --> 02:09.916
He was after the Founder
the whole time.

02:10.006 --> 02:12.296
He knew that
if he ever got caught,

02:12.386 --> 02:15.386
his wife and son would
pay the price with him.

02:15.466 --> 02:17.386
But he kept doing it anyway.

02:17.466 --> 02:19.176
And do you know why?

02:20.176 --> 02:23.686
'Cause he'd gladly drag his
family through shit for Eldia.

02:23.766 --> 02:24.896
He was a shitty human being

02:24.976 --> 02:27.856
who did a shitty job
as a father.

02:27.936 --> 02:30.146
I understand now.

02:30.236 --> 02:32.856
You've undone his brainwashing.

02:32.946 --> 02:35.986
I should've just not been born.

02:36.076 --> 02:38.236
Thanks for showing me the light.

02:41.326 --> 02:43.456
[ZEKE] We have
all the time in the world.

02:43.536 --> 02:45.376
No need to rush.

03:12.856 --> 03:14.526
Here already?

03:14.606 --> 03:17.616
Can't believe he found it
in so little time.

03:17.696 --> 03:20.286
You know this place?

03:20.366 --> 03:23.116
The King of the walls
hid out here.

03:23.206 --> 03:25.416
[ZEKE]
That doesn't make sense.

03:25.496 --> 03:27.666
Grisha stole the Founder
when the walls fell.

03:27.746 --> 03:30.756
And that won't happen
for a number of years.

03:30.836 --> 03:33.296
Why did he wait so long?

04:09.746 --> 04:11.496
[ZEKE]
I see.

04:11.586 --> 04:14.756
He delayed his mission
for the sake of his son.

04:14.836 --> 04:17.836
He set aside his cause
for his family.

04:19.806 --> 04:22.556
Would've been nice if he
could have done that for me.

04:22.636 --> 04:23.886
Good for you, though.

04:23.976 --> 04:26.596
I guess losing his first
family taught him to care.

04:26.686 --> 04:29.226
But even so,
he passed you his banner

04:29.306 --> 04:32.226
and set you marching
down his path.

04:32.316 --> 04:35.236
You'll never be the person
you could've been.

04:35.316 --> 04:37.906
You'll understand that in time.

04:44.576 --> 04:46.456
[GRISHA]
I'm sorry.

04:47.326 --> 04:49.326
Please, Zeke. Forgive me.

04:49.416 --> 04:51.206
[Gasps]

04:53.086 --> 04:54.506
It's you.

04:54.586 --> 04:56.666
[Gasps]

04:56.756 --> 04:57.966
[GRISHA]
Zeke?

04:59.336 --> 05:01.676
Zeke, is that actually you?

05:15.276 --> 05:17.356
[GRISHA]
Don't be stupid.

05:17.446 --> 05:21.986
Even if Zeke could get here,
he wouldn't be old and bearded.

05:22.066 --> 05:23.776
You're dreaming.

05:25.116 --> 05:26.496
What is this?

05:26.576 --> 05:30.786
[EREN]
Next. We're finished here.

05:30.876 --> 05:32.336
Right?

07:09.926 --> 07:12.516
[ZEKE] At this point,
you're nine years old.

07:14.056 --> 07:18.856
Grisha truly cared for you.
He let you grow up normally.

07:18.936 --> 07:22.856
He never recruited you into
the Eldian Restoration movement.

07:22.946 --> 07:25.406
I said you were
wasting your breath.

07:25.496 --> 07:26.656
We've been wandering
through years

07:26.736 --> 07:29.036
of his memories for nothing.

07:29.946 --> 07:31.996
But if that's true,
then what could've

07:32.076 --> 07:34.876
driven you to betray me?

07:34.956 --> 07:37.286
He forced you to
inherit the Attack Titan

07:37.376 --> 07:39.496
without telling you a thing.

07:39.586 --> 07:43.426
So what was it that made you
decide to carry on his battle?

07:45.586 --> 07:49.716
Eren. Why not bring an end
to centuries of war?

07:49.806 --> 07:53.976
And if peace wasn't your goal,
why seek the Founder's power?

07:55.846 --> 08:00.436
[EREN] Because.
Since the day I was born...

08:02.356 --> 08:04.606
[EREN]
...this is who I've been.

08:09.486 --> 08:11.116
[EREN] When you learned
you had a brother,

08:11.196 --> 08:13.746
you thought he'd be
the same as you,

08:13.826 --> 08:15.576
but you were wrong.

08:15.666 --> 08:18.916
If someone tries to
steal my freedom from me,

08:18.996 --> 08:22.376
I'll take theirs first,
without a second thought.

08:23.876 --> 08:25.466
Damn it. Do you understand...

08:26.546 --> 08:29.426
It wasn't because of
anything Dad did.

08:29.506 --> 08:32.596
I came into this world
ready for a fight.

08:32.676 --> 08:35.096
Since the day you were born.

08:35.176 --> 08:36.726
I'm not some pathetic little boy

08:36.806 --> 08:40.226
in need of
a big brother's guidance,

08:40.316 --> 08:41.896
and if you were
hoping we'd bond over

08:41.976 --> 08:45.856
our shared emotional scars,
you're out of luck.

08:45.946 --> 08:47.816
Here's what you've
shown me, Zeke.

08:47.906 --> 08:49.776
You resent your dad because
he cared more about

08:49.866 --> 08:52.076
restoring Eldia
than raising his son.

08:52.156 --> 08:55.286
Opposing him is all you can
think to do with your life.

08:56.576 --> 08:58.746
[EREN]
You've shown me a pathetic man

08:58.826 --> 09:01.996
still haunted by
the ghost of his father.

09:02.916 --> 09:04.756
That could be the case.

09:04.836 --> 09:08.086
Perhaps this man should be
grateful to his father.

09:08.176 --> 09:12.096
It was his miserable upbringing
that exposed him to the truth

09:12.176 --> 09:15.386
of the ongoing threat that
Eldia poses to the world.

09:16.346 --> 09:19.096
[ZEKE] In a way, that man's
father is helping him

09:19.186 --> 09:21.476
put an end to that threat.

09:21.556 --> 09:26.696
Seems more than
a little ironic, right, Eren?

09:31.566 --> 09:33.026
[MIKASA]
It's warm.

09:35.196 --> 09:37.706
Please understand,
the power of the Founder

09:37.786 --> 09:40.626
is completely under my control.

09:40.706 --> 09:41.956
There's no way to stop me

09:42.036 --> 09:44.876
from carrying out
the euthanization plan.

09:44.956 --> 09:46.466
That said,

09:46.546 --> 09:49.546
I won't move on if it
means abandoning you.

09:50.796 --> 09:54.466
[ZEKE] I'm going to do for you
what Mister Ksaver did for me.

09:55.806 --> 09:58.686
I will save you, Eren.

09:58.766 --> 10:01.896
And then, I'll save the world.

10:07.486 --> 10:10.106
[ZEKE]
His parting words?

10:10.196 --> 10:13.776
"Mankind isn't gone," he says. Ha.

10:14.696 --> 10:17.826
[ZEKE] That's quite the
revelation he left behind.

10:40.596 --> 10:42.596
[EREN]
Hey, we're home.

10:43.686 --> 10:45.686
Welcome back, kids.

10:48.226 --> 10:49.646
Oh, my goodness.

10:49.736 --> 10:52.526
Someone's working hard to keep us in fuel.

10:52.606 --> 10:53.866
Whatever.

10:57.156 --> 10:58.406
What was that for?

10:58.486 --> 11:00.076
It looks like your
earlobe's red.

11:00.156 --> 11:02.286
Which means you've got
something to hide.

11:02.366 --> 11:05.166
Mikasa helped you again,
now didn't she?

11:06.626 --> 11:09.586
[EREN]
Hey. Where you off to, Dad?

11:09.666 --> 11:11.046
- A patient?
- Yes.

11:11.126 --> 11:13.046
Some folks in the Interior.

11:13.136 --> 11:15.296
I should be back
in about a week or so.

11:18.056 --> 11:21.476
So, um, Eren's thinking
about joining the Scouts.

11:21.556 --> 11:23.266
[EREN]
Way to keep a secret, mouth!

11:23.346 --> 11:24.516
[CARLA]
Get that ridiculous thought

11:24.596 --> 11:26.726
out of your head
this instant, young man!

11:26.816 --> 11:29.026
No son of mine
is going to be fodder!

11:29.106 --> 11:31.066
Do I make myself
absolutely clear?

11:31.146 --> 11:32.356
[EREN]
Stop yelling at me!

11:32.446 --> 11:33.276
[CARLA]
Don't you dare--!

11:33.356 --> 11:35.736
- Outside.
- [EREN gasps]

11:35.816 --> 11:38.366
It's a nightmare,
you have no idea.

11:38.446 --> 11:41.246
[EREN gasps]
Yeah, I get it, okay?

11:41.326 --> 11:43.826
But it's gotta be
better than this life!

11:43.906 --> 11:45.366
I'm not stupid.

11:45.456 --> 11:47.076
I know it's ugly out there,

11:47.166 --> 11:49.916
I know there's death
around every corner. But...

11:49.996 --> 11:52.296
We can't just give up on it.

11:52.376 --> 11:55.676
'Cause otherwise this
nightmare's never gonna end!

11:57.466 --> 11:59.056
I see.

12:00.886 --> 12:03.186
[GRISHA] Excuse me.
I'll be late for the ferry.

12:03.266 --> 12:04.516
[CARLA]
Darling, wait!

12:04.596 --> 12:06.556
Scold the boy,
for heaven's sake!

12:06.646 --> 12:07.806
Scold him?

12:07.896 --> 12:10.026
Dear, please,
think this through.

12:10.106 --> 12:13.316
Mere words won't hold back
the boy's curiosity.

12:14.656 --> 12:15.816
[GRISHA]
Eren.

12:16.946 --> 12:18.946
Behave yourself and
I'll let you in on

12:19.026 --> 12:22.286
what I've been doing
down in the cellar. Agreed?

12:22.366 --> 12:24.286
[EREN]
Yes sir, you got it!

12:28.376 --> 12:30.336
Have a good trip!

12:48.146 --> 12:49.606
[GRISHA]
Please, listen!

12:49.686 --> 12:52.816
I'm an Eldian who came
from beyond the walls!

12:52.896 --> 12:57.906
I am a subject of Ymir,
just like all of you!

13:03.196 --> 13:06.116
[GRISHA]
King of the walls! I beg you.

13:06.206 --> 13:09.166
Kill the Titans
attacking Wall Maria

13:09.246 --> 13:11.036
before my wife and children,

13:11.126 --> 13:15.166
and thousands of others,
are all eaten alive!

13:28.556 --> 13:31.186
The day of judgment
has finally come,

13:31.266 --> 13:33.226
and we, as Subjects of Ymir,

13:33.316 --> 13:35.316
must now reap
the wages of our sins.

13:35.396 --> 13:37.106
[Gasps]

13:37.196 --> 13:39.446
When it comes to
great and terrible power,

13:39.526 --> 13:41.316
humankind is weak.

13:41.406 --> 13:45.446
This was proven many times
during the Great Titan War.

13:45.536 --> 13:47.456
Such is the power of the Titans,

13:47.536 --> 13:50.996
that in human hands,
it inevitably brings ruin.

13:51.076 --> 13:52.286
The power of the Founder,

13:52.376 --> 13:55.126
if returned to the
weak-willed custody of man,

13:55.206 --> 13:58.756
would plunge the world,
once more, into hell.

13:58.836 --> 14:00.966
Eldia's sins are
what wrought this terror,

14:01.046 --> 14:03.296
so to save the world
and put it to rest,

14:03.386 --> 14:05.886
we Eldians must embrace death.

14:05.966 --> 14:09.266
I'd say she about summed up
my argument for me.

14:09.346 --> 14:10.726
But it fell on deaf ears.

14:10.806 --> 14:13.896
Grisha slaughtered
her entire family.

14:13.976 --> 14:15.146
You've seen this part.

14:15.226 --> 14:17.526
You mentioned it
when we first met.

14:17.606 --> 14:20.316
I recall you saying that
what he did was a mistake.

14:20.406 --> 14:21.816
Was that a lie, too?

14:21.906 --> 14:22.986
[ZEKE gasps]

14:23.066 --> 14:24.406
[GRISHA] I live in
the Shiganshina District

14:24.486 --> 14:25.736
with my family.

14:25.826 --> 14:28.156
Our house is by Wall Maria,
near the breach.

14:28.246 --> 14:31.536
My wife and children are
directly in the Titans' path!

14:31.626 --> 14:34.206
How are you willing to condemn
everyone in the walls to death

14:34.286 --> 14:36.336
for the crimes of
their ancestors?

14:38.006 --> 14:39.966
you stole their memories!

14:40.046 --> 14:41.876
They'll die between
those monsters' jaws,

14:41.966 --> 14:43.346
ignorant and scared.

14:43.426 --> 14:46.806
Can you honestly
call that atonement?

14:46.886 --> 14:50.886
No. Proper atonement is
beyond our ability.

14:50.976 --> 14:54.226
The lives stolen by the Eldian
Empire can never be returned.

14:54.306 --> 14:56.356
They are lost.

14:56.436 --> 15:01.196
However. What we can do is
refuse to take any more lives,

15:01.276 --> 15:03.406
at least outside the walls.

15:04.406 --> 15:06.866
If we can just live out
our lives in ignorance

15:06.946 --> 15:09.996
and then accept the
world's rage when it comes,

15:10.076 --> 15:14.166
then no one will have to die,
except us Eldians.

15:17.456 --> 15:18.586
[FRIEDA]
There's nothing you can say to

15:18.666 --> 15:20.876
dissuade me from this course.

15:20.966 --> 15:23.716
What's more, even if you
were to defeat me and

15:26.386 --> 15:27.636
[GRISHA]
I know.

15:28.806 --> 15:32.176
I wouldn't be able to make use
of the Founder's power.

15:33.186 --> 15:34.936
Each of the Nine is unique,

15:35.016 --> 15:37.476
distinguished by
a certain trait.

15:37.566 --> 15:41.526
Like the Attack Titan,
whose power was passed to me.

15:41.606 --> 15:44.906
For ages, we who've
inherited the Attack Titan

15:44.986 --> 15:48.286
have bucked the authority of
any who sought to control us,

15:48.366 --> 15:51.246
and I've finally come to
understand why.

15:51.326 --> 15:55.246
We're meant to oppose the
self-righteousness of the King!

15:55.326 --> 15:57.836
Yes. This must be
the moment our memories

15:57.916 --> 16:00.706
have been leading us
toward for generations.

16:00.796 --> 16:03.756
The power of the
Attack Titan offers us

16:03.836 --> 16:07.386
brief glimpses into the lives
of those yet to inherit it.

16:07.466 --> 16:12.556
Meaning it allows us to witness
events in the future.

16:16.346 --> 16:19.646
He can witness the future?

16:19.726 --> 16:22.686
What does that mean? Eren?

16:24.236 --> 16:27.156
The Attack Titan can
see into the future?

16:28.736 --> 16:29.826
I came here knowing
that you would

16:29.906 --> 16:31.946
be ignorant on that subject.

16:32.036 --> 16:33.456
It's a consequence of
the way you've been

16:33.536 --> 16:36.496
shackled by the vow
renouncing war.

16:36.576 --> 16:39.956
You can't use the Founder's
full power, either.

16:40.036 --> 16:42.836
The future is already
long since decided.

16:42.916 --> 16:45.376
I'm going to eat
the Founding Titan

16:45.466 --> 16:49.806
and bring an end to the
royal bloodline, right now!

16:49.886 --> 16:51.006
[Gasps] Run!

16:51.096 --> 16:54.136
[Yells]

17:04.986 --> 17:06.356
[Gasps]

17:08.906 --> 17:10.616
I can't do it.

17:13.236 --> 17:17.456
[GRISHA] I'm a doctor.
My job is to save lives.

17:19.036 --> 17:22.836
I would never murder
innocent children.

17:22.916 --> 17:24.586
How could I?

17:24.666 --> 17:26.546
No, this can't be.

17:26.626 --> 17:28.836
Grisha did steal
the power of the Founder.

17:28.926 --> 17:31.136
He slaughtered
the whole royal family!

17:31.216 --> 17:32.886
So how?

17:32.966 --> 17:34.306
It's in the past.

17:34.386 --> 17:36.926
It can't just change.

17:38.686 --> 17:40.436
[ROD] What are you
waiting for, Frieda?

17:40.516 --> 17:43.316
You need to kill
that man right now!

17:43.396 --> 17:45.026
He's no match for the Founder!

17:45.106 --> 17:46.986
Crush him before he can run!

17:47.066 --> 17:49.066
Frieda! If you let
that man leave here alive,

17:49.156 --> 17:50.236
he'll ruin everything!

17:50.316 --> 17:52.366
You have to, Frieda,
you know that!

17:52.446 --> 17:54.786
Don't let him destroy
the paradise we've built!

17:54.866 --> 17:58.576
[FRIEDA'S MOTHER] Frieda!
We need you to protect us!

18:00.786 --> 18:01.536
[DIRK REISS]
Frieda!

18:01.626 --> 18:03.336
[FRIEDA'S MOTHER]
Please!

18:06.086 --> 18:09.926
On your feet, Dad.
You're not done yet.

18:13.216 --> 18:14.846
In case you've forgotten.

18:14.926 --> 18:17.766
You have your own
reasons for coming.

18:17.846 --> 18:19.226
You had a little sister,

18:19.306 --> 18:22.266
'til that man
fed her to his dogs.

18:22.356 --> 18:27.736
Think of your slaughtered
comrades, of Kruger, of Dina.

18:27.816 --> 18:29.486
Avenge them.

18:31.356 --> 18:33.816
[EREN]
Keep moving forward.

18:33.906 --> 18:35.326
Even if you die.

18:35.406 --> 18:37.446
Even after you die.

18:41.706 --> 18:48.166
[EREN] After all, this whole
ugly story started with you.

18:48.256 --> 18:52.386
[GRISHA yells]

19:39.926 --> 19:41.766
I killed them all!

19:41.846 --> 19:44.686
Even the little kids!

19:44.766 --> 19:46.976
With my own hands!

19:48.146 --> 19:52.146
Eren! I slaughtered
the whole Reiss family.

19:52.236 --> 19:54.736
All but the father!

19:54.816 --> 19:57.196
Is that enough for you?

19:57.276 --> 20:00.076
Did you get what you wanted?

20:00.156 --> 20:02.536
Will crushing those
children in my hands

20:02.616 --> 20:05.496
really bring Eldia back?

20:11.666 --> 20:15.426
Why is there still so much
you refuse to show me?

20:15.506 --> 20:18.216
I never saw
the fall of the walls.

20:18.306 --> 20:21.056
What becomes of my home?

20:21.136 --> 20:23.306
Is Carla going to make it?

20:24.266 --> 20:26.396
Was there no other way forward?

20:26.476 --> 20:29.016
Was this really
the right choice?

20:32.356 --> 20:36.236
[GRISHA] You're here
watching me now, right, Zeke?

20:37.486 --> 20:38.736
[GRISHA]
From here on out,

20:38.826 --> 20:41.826
nothing is going to go
the way you'd hoped.

20:41.906 --> 20:44.906
Eren will get
everything he wants.

20:46.956 --> 20:50.746
[GRISHA] I've seen it.
I've witnessed Eren's memories.

20:50.836 --> 20:52.416
What humanity is about to endure

20:52.506 --> 20:55.256
is far worse than
I could imagine.

20:55.336 --> 20:57.966
[GRISHA gasps]
Zeke.

20:59.796 --> 21:02.136
That's you, right, Zeke?

21:02.216 --> 21:04.936
You've gotten so big!

21:05.016 --> 21:06.226
I'm sorry.

21:06.306 --> 21:09.436
I know I was never
the father you deserved.

21:09.516 --> 21:11.356
After all I put you through,

21:11.436 --> 21:14.186
you have every right
to despise me.

21:16.276 --> 21:22.026
[Sobs] But even so,
I will always love you.

21:22.116 --> 21:24.906
If only... I'd let you be my son

21:24.996 --> 21:28.286
instead of trying
to make you a soldier!

21:28.376 --> 21:35.376
[GRISHA sobbing]

21:47.016 --> 21:48.976
Oh, Father.

21:50.646 --> 21:55.436
Please, Zeke.
You have to stop Eren.

21:55.526 --> 21:56.896
[ZEKE gasps]

21:57.986 --> 21:59.196
[Groans]

22:01.696 --> 22:03.116
[Gasps]

23:40.876 --> 23:43.886
[NARRATOR] Opposing forces
arise, and clash,

23:43.966 --> 23:46.806
and the cycle carries on
without pause.

